<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hirsch International.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hirsch International.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Hirsch International Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target price of $30.</p>
<p>-- said expects Hirsch to continue to capture share in the expanding domestic embroidery machine market.</p>
<p>-- expects Hirsch to earn $1.34 a share in fiscal 1998 and $1.60 a share in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Hirsch was up 1-1/8 to 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
